<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>2.10.1</Version>
    <Authors>dgerman</Authors>
    <Company>dgerman</Company>
    <Product>LEANN MCP Server</Product>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 Damon German</Copyright>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/d-german/leann-dotnet</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Ignore patterns now support [...] bracket expressions, so the stock Visual Studio .gitignore actually excludes [Bb]in/ and [Oo]bj/. In-tree .leannignore files are honoured alongside .gitignore, and --ignore-file applies a workspace-wide ignore list across every repo. An LEANN_MODEL override of the default code model is now reported instead of applying silently.</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
